WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:10.750
77. Rock Climbing It gives me a chance to feel like a kid again,

2
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:17.950
says Sherry. I love the challenge. I love the outdoors. I love that it is a very individual

3
00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:24.150
sport, says Mark. I believe the mountains were made for me to climb them, says Colin.

4
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:29.750
They're all talking about rock climbing or mountain climbing, a sport that is both exciting

5
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:36.110
and sometimes deadly. Rock climbing is what it sounds like, crawling up a rock, using

6
00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:42.330
your hands and feet. Climbers ascend nearly vertical rock faces, sometimes hundreds of

7
00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:49.830
feet in the air. They climb little by little, sometimes only moving inches at a time. Because

8
00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:57.510
they climb so high above hard rock surfaces, climbing can be very dangerous. For this reason,

9
00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:02.710
many climbers use safety equipment. They may wear special climbing shoes or gloves

10
00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:08.910
that help them grip rocks. They often use ropes to stop them if they fall. Some wear

11
00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:15.110
helmets to protect their heads from falling rocks. The danger of climbing both pulls people

12
00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:24.070
to the sport and pushes them away. The danger adds to the thrill of the sport. Statistically,

13
00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:29.750
climbing is much safer than driving in a car. People playing football and soccer hurt

14
00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:37.590
themselves more often, but the danger of climbing is real. Alone, halfway up a mountain, there's

15
00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:45.150
no one to save you but yourself. Climbing forces you to take care of yourself, but accidents

16
00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:52.710
happen. Rocks break, climbing partners slip, and people trip over the ropes. One small

17
00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:59.470
mistake can mean death. Rock climbing is an intense, individual challenge for your

18
00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:07.390
mind and body. If you want to try rock climbing, practice in a climbing gym first. Gain strength,

19
00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:14.150
experience, and confidence. Then, see if you're one of those people who want to tackle mountains.
